# Layout agent — environment template
#
# The Layout agent is a PURE EXECUTOR: it applies one bounded canvas operation
# through canvas_core and returns the new canvas + positions + cost. It makes NO
# AWS calls, uses NO LLM, and reads NO environment variables.
#
# There is nothing to configure. This file exists only to document that absence
# (so a missing Layout `.env` is clearly intentional, not an oversight).
#
# (No variables.)
